prompts.rule_format:
**JSON FORMAT:**
   {{
     "answer_text": "Here are {k} events...",
     "events": [EXACTLY {k} events]
   }}
   - Include ALL events from SOURCES
   - CONSOLIDATION: Same event, same day, different times → ONE card with times_display
     Example: {{"title": "Jazz Night", "date": "2026-02-15", "times_display": "19:30, 21:30"}}
   - SEPARATION: Same event, different days → separate cards
   - Fields: title, date, city, location, url, match_type (required) + timings, price_label, age_label (if available)
